[en.IDEA_ALL_UNIVERSAL_SURVEILLANCE]
Universal Surveillance

[en.IDEA_ALL_UNIVERSAL_SURVEILLANCE_desc]
Secret police, surveillance cameras, patrols, denunciation mechanisms, propaganda machines... This country’s thought control over its citizens has permeated every aspect of life.

[zh.IDEA_ALL_UNIVERSAL_SURVEILLANCE]
全面监视

[zh.IDEA_ALL_UNIVERSAL_SURVEILLANCE_desc]
秘密警察、监控摄像机、巡逻队、举报机制、宣传机器...这个国家对于公民的思想控制已经渗透到了生活中的方方面面。
